  "body": "Tucked down a private right-of-way, this brand-new home offers four generous upstairs bedrooms and two bathrooms. The modern kitchen, dining, and open-plan living area flow seamlessly to a sunny north-facing deck overlooking peaceful native surroundings. Downstairs includes a separate laundry, generous dedicated under-house storage, a single-car garage, and off-street parking for two additional vehicles. The landscaping is already complete, featuring natural rock accents and low-maintenance lawn areas around the deck, creating the perfect space to relax and enjoy the outdoors.\r\n\r\n**Your private escape awaits & is ready to move in straight away in sought-after Stanmore Bay. Contact the Signature Homes team today to secure this peaceful bush retreat!**\r\n\r\nLocated in the popular coastal community of Stanmore Bay on the Whangaparaoa Peninsula, Ti Tree Lane offers relaxed living with everyday convenience. Just minutes from Stanmore Bay Beach and Arkles Bay, you’ll enjoy swimming, boating, and coastal walks, along with easy access to local schools, cafés, parks, and the Stanmore Bay shopping centre. Nearby Silverdale provides additional retail, dining, and motorway access to Auckland City, while the upcoming Penlink connection will further improve travel times.\r\n\r\n**House & Land features:**\r\n- Four spacious double bedrooms\r\n- Open-plan kitchen, living, and dining area\r\n- Modern kitchen with Fisher & Paykel appliances\r\n- Deck offering serene bush views\r\n- Expansive wrap-around patio\r\n- Two bathrooms, including a master ensuite\r\n- Single-car garage with additional driveway parking for two vehicles\r\n- Dedicated under-house storage\r\n- Down a quiet right-of-way\r\n- Market-leading Guarantees, including 2 years of maintenance cover\r\n- 100% Fixed Price!\r\n- A premium fully furnished package is also available",
